History
-------

1.0.0  Initial Aminet release.

       - MintScan GUI: discovery, capability query, and single-page
         scan-to-file over eSCL (ScannerCapabilities / ScanJobs /
         NextDocument)
       - mDNS LAN discovery for _uscan._tcp and _uscans._tcp, plus
         manual IP entry for networks mDNS multicast can't reach
       - Source/Colour/DPI/Format/Page size selection, validated
         against the scanner's queried capabilities at scan time
       - Up to eight saved scanner profiles (Unit0-Unit7)
       - Timeout-bounded connection with one retry, so scanners that
         power down their Wi-Fi radio between jobs still get a fair
         chance to answer
       - Chunked-transfer-safe document download
